### Listar de Cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LogReq.request.body.token}}

### Consultar Cliente por Código
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LogReq.request.body.token}}

### Consultar Cliente por Nome
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/Eliel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LogReq.request.body.token}}

### Atualizar de Cliente
PUT  http://localhost:3000/cliente/id
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LogReq.request.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Lucas",
    "cpf": "12345678915",
    "telefone": "4812345677"
}

